[{"answer":"I'm trying to find a wedding anniversary present for my wife.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/78-buying-a-present---in-a-jewellers-shop-2022-03-07-21-30-03/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, sir. What exactly are you looking for?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/78-buying-a-present---in-a-jewellers-shop-2022-03-07-21-30-03/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm not sure, really. Perhaps you can help me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/78-buying-a-present---in-a-jewellers-shop-2022-03-07-21-30-03/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Right... I'll show you some pendants.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/78-buying-a-present---in-a-jewellers-shop-2022-03-07-21-30-03/4.mp3"},{"answer":"No, I bought a pendant for her birthday.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/78-buying-a-present---in-a-jewellers-shop-2022-03-07-21-30-03/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe a necklace, then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/78-buying-a-present---in-a-jewellers-shop-2022-03-07-21-30-03/6.mp3"},{"answer":"These necklaces are made of gold.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/78-buying-a-present---in-a-jewellers-shop-2022-03-07-21-30-03/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes... I like this one. What's the stone?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/78-buying-a-present---in-a-jewellers-shop-2022-03-07-21-30-03/8.mp3"},{"answer":"It's a ruby, sir... and it's only $1200!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/78-buying-a-present---in-a-jewellers-shop-2022-03-07-21-30-03/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah... well, perhaps you could show me some bracelets, then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/78-buying-a-present---in-a-jewellers-shop-2022-03-07-21-30-03/10.mp3"}]
